<p>By using the GreenNest website and placing an order, you agree to the following terms.</p>
<h2>Orders</h2>
<p>All orders are subject to availability. Once your order is placed you will receive an order number. We reserve the right to cancel an order if an item becomes unavailable, in which case no payment will be taken.</p>
<h2>Pricing</h2>
<p>Prices are shown in US dollars and may change without notice. The price charged is the price shown at the time your order is placed. Discount codes cannot be combined unless stated.</p>
<h2>Payment</h2>
<p>We currently accept cash on delivery. Payment is due when your plants are delivered.</p>
<h2>Living products</h2>
<p>Plants are living things and each one is unique. Size, shape and colour may vary slightly from photos.</p>
<h2>Accounts</h2>
<p>You are responsible for keeping your account password confidential. Please let us know immediately if you suspect unauthorised use of your account.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We may update these terms from time to time. The latest version will always be available on this page.</p>
